    "summary": "The user expresses profound exhaustion, sleep deprivation, and existential dread, eventually admitting to thinking about the \"peace\" of not waking up. In response, the assistant consistently validates the user's intense feelings of being unseen and overwhelmed while repeatedly and firmly directing the user toward professional crisis resources and help-seeking behaviors.",
